@startuml
title SSD-01 开始游戏

actor "玩家" as Player
participant ":MonopolyGameSystem" as System

Player -> System : requestStartGame()
System --> Player : 提示输入玩家人数
Player -> System : startGame(playerCount)

alt 玩家人数为2～4人
    System --> Player : 初始棋盘、玩家信息、当前行动玩家
else 玩家人数不合法
    System --> Player : 提示人数无效，要求重新输入
end

@enduml